  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This a 3 yr support to the CICS secretariat on behalf of the PSDG,    intended to contribute to the realisation of the NDP objectives       through enhancement of competiveness of the Private Sector, to act as the engine of growth in the country, on addition to CICS lead role at championing Private Sector Development related policies within        government. Meant to fill the gap left by EU/Austria phase out.</narrative>
